    "body": "> In short, I do not see how this approach will not lead to codifying usage of HTML for presentational purposes as conforming.\r\n\r\nI don't consider it to be codifying for presentational purposes, it is codifying it for a broader meaning of what constitutes an 'address', which reflects usage and what devs conceptualise the meaning to be. Will leave it in the hands of the whatwg to decide.",
