    "body": "Some user context:\r\n\r\nWe were looking into using the address element for our [Help users to\r\nContact a department or service team](https://design-system.service.gov.uk/patterns/contact-a-department-or-service-team/) pattern, which would have been appropriate with the W3C definition however the WHATWG definition prevents us from making this future friendly. \r\n\r\nYou can see more here: https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-design-system/issues/1104",
